# Pull Request Information

- **PR #**: 446
- **URL**: https://github.com/epam/dmtools-dart/pull/446
- **Title**: fix(agents): map GitHub composite keys to input/gh-N and bind inputFolderPath in context JS actions
- **Author**: IstiN
- **Branch**: `fix/input-folder-name-and-js-bindings` → `main`
- **State**: open
- **Files Changed**: 4
- **Additions**: +121
- **Deletions**: -11
- **Created**: 2026-10-20T21:42:22Z
- **Updated**: 2026-10-20T22:01:07Z

## PR Description

Aligns `dmtools-dart` input folder naming and JS action bindings with `dmtools` (Java) and `dmtools-agents#1094`:
- Maps GitHub composite ticket keys (`owner/repo#N`, `#N`) to `input/gh-N` via `TicketInputContextBuilder.toInputFolderName` while preserving existing keys (`PROJ-123`, `batch/run-42`, etc.) for backward compatibility.
- Probes `input/<toInputFolderName(contextId)>/ticket.json` before falling back to `input/<contextId>/ticket.json` in `CliAgent._resolveTicketData`.
- Binds `_inputContextPath` as `inputFolderPath` in context JS actions (`timerJSAction`, `cliExecutionErrorJSAction`, `cliOutputLineJSAction`).
----
# pr-446: fix(agents): map GitHub composite keys to input/gh-N and bind inputFolderPath in context JS actions

## Description

Aligns `dmtools-dart` input folder naming and JS action bindings with `dmtools` (Java) and `dmtools-agents#1094`:
- Maps GitHub composite ticket keys (`owner/repo#N`, `#N`) to `input/gh-N` via `TicketInputContextBuilder.toInputFolderName` while preserving existing keys (`PROJ-123`, `batch/run-42`, etc.) for backward compatibility.
- Probes `input/<toInputFolderName(contextId)>/ticket.json` before falling back to `input/<contextId>/ticket.json` in `CliAgent._resolveTicketData`.
- Binds `_inputContextPath` as `inputFolderPath` in context JS actions (`timerJSAction`, `cliExecutionErrorJSAction`, `cliOutputLineJSAction`).
----
207 input/pr-446/pr_diff.txt
diff --git a/lib/src/agents/cli_agent.dart b/lib/src/agents/cli_agent.dart
index be3a0214..127a2a8f 100644
--- a/lib/src/agents/cli_agent.dart
+++ b/lib/src/agents/cli_agent.dart
@@ -531,7 +531,7 @@ class CliAgent {
     try {
       return jsRunner.runScript(
         scriptPath: actionPath,
-        jobParams: _buildJobParams(null, null),
+        jobParams: _buildJobParams(null, _inputContextPath),
         ticket: _resolvedTicketData ?? ticketData,
         workingDirectory: workDir,
         config: JsRunConfig(
@@ -562,7 +562,10 @@ class CliAgent {
     Map<String, dynamic> context,
     String workDir,
   ) {
-    return {..._buildExtraGlobals(null, null, workDir), ...context};
+    return {
+      ..._buildExtraGlobals(null, _inputContextPath, workDir),
+      ...context
+    };
   }

   /// Whether the strict-mode guard applies: `requireCliOutputFile=true` and
@@ -699,14 +702,25 @@ class CliAgent {
   Map<String, dynamic>? _resolveTicketData(String workDir) {
     if (ticketData != null) return ticketData;
     if (params.contextId.isEmpty) return null;
-    final file = File('$workDir/input/${params.contextId}/ticket.json');
-    if (!file.existsSync()) return null;
-    try {
-      final decoded = jsonDecode(file.readAsStringSync());
-      return decoded is Map<String, dynamic> ? decoded : null;
-    } catch (_) {
-      return null;
+    final folderName = TicketInputContextBuilder.toInputFolderName(
+      params.contextId,
+    );
+    final candidates = <String>[
+      '$workDir/input/$folderName/ticket.json',
+      if (folderName != params.contextId)
+        '$workDir/input/${params.contextId}/ticket.json',
+    ];
+    for (final path in candidates) {
+      final file = File(path);
+      if (!file.existsSync()) continue;
+      try {
+        final decoded = jsonDecode(file.readAsStringSync());
+        if (decoded is Map<String, dynamic>) return decoded;
+      } catch (_) {
+        // Ignore malformed ticket.json and continue.
+      }
     }
+    return null;
   }

   /// Ensures the `outputs/` folder exists before CLI commands run.
diff --git a/lib/src/agents/ticket_input_context_builder.dart b/lib/src/agents/ticket_input_context_builder.dart
index c7e7a71b..26e46eba 100644
--- a/lib/src/agents/ticket_input_context_builder.dart
+++ b/lib/src/agents/ticket_input_context_builder.dart
@@ -25,12 +25,31 @@ class TicketInputContextBuilder {
   /// Base directory for the `input/` folder.
   final String workingDirectory;

+  static final RegExp _githubCompositeKey = RegExp(r'^[\w.-]+/[\w.-]+#(\d+)$');
+  static final RegExp _githubBareKey = RegExp(r'^#(\d+)$');
+
+  /// Maps a ticket/context key to the `input/` subfolder name.
+  ///
+  /// Mirrors Java `CliExecutionHelper.toInputFolderName`: a GitHub composite
+  /// key (`owner/repo#12` or `#12`) becomes the router key `gh-12` so JS
+  /// agents and CLI prompts read a single flat `input/gh-12/` folder instead
+  /// of a nested `input/owner/repo#12/` path. Other keys are preserved as-is
+  /// for backward compatibility.
+  static String toInputFolderName(String contextId) {
+    final composite = _githubCompositeKey.firstMatch(contextId);
+    if (composite != null) return 'gh-${composite.group(1)}';
+    final bare = _githubBareKey.firstMatch(contextId);
+    if (bare != null) return 'gh-${bare.group(1)}';
+    return contextId;
+  }
+
   /// Builds the input context for [contextId] from [ticketData].
   ///
   /// If [ticketData] is null (no tracker configured), creates an empty
-  /// `input/<contextId>/` folder. Returns the path to the context folder.
+  /// `input/<folderName>/` folder. Returns the path to the context folder.
   String build(String contextId, {Map<String, dynamic>? ticketData}) {
-    final contextPath = '$workingDirectory/input/$contextId';
+    final folderName = toInputFolderName(contextId);
+    final contextPath = '$workingDirectory/input/$folderName';
     Directory(contextPath).createSync(recursive: true);
     if (ticketData == null) return contextPath;
     _writeTicketFiles(contextPath, ticketData);
