## Description

Aligns `dmtools-dart` input folder naming and JS action bindings with `dmtools` (Java) and `dmtools-agents#1094`:
- Maps GitHub composite ticket keys (`owner/repo#N`, `#N`) to `input/gh-N` via `TicketInputContextBuilder.toInputFolderName` while preserving existing keys (`PROJ-123`, `batch/run-42`, etc.) for backward compatibility.
- Probes `input/<toInputFolderName(contextId)>/ticket.json` before falling back to `input/<contextId>/ticket.json` in `CliAgent._resolveTicketData`.
- Binds `_inputContextPath` as `inputFolderPath` in context JS actions (`timerJSAction`, `cliExecutionErrorJSAction`, `cliOutputLineJSAction`).
